%% description: When the teammate calls step_done: a rule that holds refuses the call, and the model writes, then calls again (the table at_step_done.json says what each rule does). The rules move here one by one from the host's code.
%% param: step json! -- the facts of the step at the call: text_since_last_tool, text_in_step, used_tools, step_done, plan, turn
%% result: chain.verdict
graph LR
    facts["RhaiNode(script='input', value=$step)"]
    chain["FirstMatch(rules='none_yet', otherwise='accept')"]
